# Build output is produced inside the image, never shipped into it.
#
# Without this, `COPY . .` uploads the local bin/ and obj/ — 84 MB of
# Windows-built assemblies, and an obj/project.assets.json whose restore paths
# point at C:\Users\..., which the Linux build then tries to use. Keeping them
# out makes the build both smaller and reproducible.
bin/
obj/

# Nothing here is needed to build the service, and the licensed Syncfusion
# assemblies under bin/ are exactly what should not leave this machine.
*.user
.vs/
.vscode/
